        "entry_mNHdTg": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "Why is my leaf blower not starting?",
            "text": "<p>This could be one of four reasons:</p><p>1. The battery is not securely fitted. To secure the battery make sure the latches on the<br/>bottom of the battery snap<br/>into place.</p><p>2. The battery is not charged.<br/>Charge the battery according to the instructions in the manual.</p><p>3. The battery is defective. Replace with a new, charged<br/>battery. </p><p>4. Defective power switch. Contact us to resolve.</p>",
